OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy and
OL,6,Fshowery conditions will continue to
OL,7,Faffect the east and southeast of
OL,8,FEngland this evening and overnight.
OL,9,FLargely dry elsewhere with clear
OL,10,Fperiods and lighter winds. Patches of
OL,11,Ffog and frost forming, especially
OL,12,Facross Northern Ireland and southern
OL,13,FScotland.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSunday:FThe east, and more especially
OL,16,Fsoutheast of England will remain
OL,17,Fbreezy with showers, some heavy.
OL,18,FShowers may extend westwards into
OL,19,Fcentral and southern England later.
OL,20,FFine elsewhere with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
